//CompilerWarnings Suspend

Use FlexCom20.pkg

Define OLEXTPApplicationAmbientProperty for Integer
    // Ambient accent color value. -1 should be used to specify a default accent color value determined individually by each suscribed client.
    Define OLExtpApplicationAccentColor for 0
    // Ambient state color value. -1 should be used to specify a default state color value determined individually by each suscribed client.
    Define OLExtpApplicationStateColor for 1

